# Real Supabase URL/anon key for --dart-define-from-file (see
# dart_define.example.json and the README). Never commit the filled-in
# version -- it's not a secret (the anon key is public-by-design), but
# keeping it out of source matches the rest of this repo's env-file
# convention and avoids baking one environment into the tree.
/dart_define.json
